### PowerShell Commands to Modify Defender Exclusion Lists

You can use PowerShell to modify the exclusion lists in Windows Defender like so:

```powershell
Add-MpPreference -ExclusionPath "C:\Path\To\Exclude"
Add-MpPreference -ExclusionProcess "ProcessToExclude.exe"
```

